1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,520
What if the money was already
there… and the strategy wasn’t?

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:11,996
Without an endorsed, costed national
strategy, funding cycles don’t open,

3
00:00:12,076 --> 00:00:13,420
and children wait.

4
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:18,730
I’m Dr. Dian Sidibé. For twenty-eight
years, across the United Nations,

5
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:22,313
Gavi-supported programmes
and humanitarian operations,

6
00:00:22,393 --> 00:00:27,687
I have helped ministries of health turn
evidence into strategies that get funded.

7
00:00:28,167 --> 00:00:34,099
Lead costing in five countries.
Twenty-three country offices overseen.

8
00:00:34,179 --> 00:00:37,620
More than fifteen national teams trained.

9
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:44,675
I work in three ways. I unlock financing
that is budgeted but not flowing.

10
00:00:44,755 --> 00:00:49,914
I architect national immunisation
strategies that are endorsed,

11
00:00:49,994 --> 00:00:55,487
costed and fundable. And I build
the national capacity to own them.

12
00:00:56,367 --> 00:01:07,320
My method is fast and fully traceable:
AI-accelerated, always human-validated.

13
00:01:16,333 --> 00:01:20,153
Strategies ministries
own. Plans donors fund.

14
00:01:20,633 --> 00:01:24,353
Let’s talk about your next strategy cycle.
